{63}{Well, for the most part, what you see is what's here. We've got your usual stores and blacksmith. There's the Joyful Dog Tavern if you want a drink or need to rest up a bit. That's about it.}{Well, for the most part, what you see is what's here. We've got your usual stores and blacksmith. There's the Joyful Dog Tavern if you want a drink or need to rest up a bit. That's about it.}{}{}{}{}
