{67}{[He scratches his temple] Not too awful much. Of course, with more and more people moving into the area, old ruins and such are constantly being discovered. The best I can tell you is to wander around and see what you can find.}{[He scratches his temple] Not too awful much. Of course, with more and more people moving into the area, old ruins and such are constantly being discovered. The best I can tell you is to wander around and see what you can find.}{}{}{}{}
