{71}{Not as much as we used to. Ever since some elves cut the Jamestown ferry loose, everyone's been going to Portsmouth and taking a ship to get across. }{Not as much as we used to. Ever since some elves cut the Jamestown ferry loose, everyone's been going to Portsmouth and taking a ship to get across. }{}{}{}{}
