{77}{Ahh, those blasted, self-rightous pointy-ears are in an uproar about humans getting close to their precious Glimmering Forest. A pack of them came whoopin' and hollerin' out of the woods and chased everyone back onto the ferry. Then their leader waited until it was out in the middle of the river and cut the cable.}{Ahh, those blasted, self-rightous pointy-ears are in an uproar about humans getting close to their precious Glimmering Forest. A pack of them came whoopin' and hollerin' out of the woods and chased everyone back onto the ferry. Then their leader waited until it was out in the middle of the river and cut the cable.}{}{}{}{ru 2237}
{78}{That's terrible! Was anyone hurt?}{}{5}{}{80}{}
{79}{Dat not nice! Wuz anyone hurt?}{}{-4}{}{80}{}
{80}{Thankfully no. Everyone managed to stay on board. The ferry finally grounded on a sandbar a few miles downriver. Funny thing though, the leader was a raven-haired she-elf and she's the only one of the elves who said a word - other than the whoopin' and hollerin' of course.}{Thankfully no. Everyone managed to stay on board. The ferry finally grounded on a sandbar a few miles downriver. Funny thing though, the leader was a raven-haired she-elf and she's the only one of the elves who said a word - other than the whoopin' and hollerin' of course.}{}{}{}{}
{81}{What was that?}{}{1}{}{82}{}
{82}{Quote: "Nevermore!"}{Quote: "Nevermore!"}{}{}{}{}
